          "dct:publisher": "regca-1crypto:publisher/rutgers-carlab-engineering-sciences-laboratory-ibn-tofail-university-auditchain-labs-ag",
          "dct:title": "El Imami, Oh, Meyers, Brennan, Vasarhelyi, Sannella, Egan et al., Beyond the Fiat Vault: Evaluating Machine-Readable Blockchain Disclosures for Systemic Safety, Operational Security, and MEV Conflict Mitigation (BNP Disclosure Taxonomy paper)",
          "dct:bibliographicCitation": "PDF p. 9",
          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"requires digital asset issuers to disclose the operational characteristics, concentration risks, affiliate relationships, third-party service provider dependencies, and conflict-of-interest exposures arising from their participation in blockchain network infrastructure\"",
