          "dct:title": "El Imami, Oh, Meyers, Brennan, Vasarhelyi, Sannella, Egan et al., Beyond the Fiat Vault: Evaluating Machine-Readable Blockchain Disclosures for Systemic Safety, Operational Security, and MEV Conflict Mitigation (BNP Disclosure Taxonomy paper)",
          "dct:bibliographicCitation": "PDF p. 11",
          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"Identifies the attack surface baseline. It specifies the name and type of the blockchain protocol used, the consensus mechanism (PoW/PoS), and the smart contract deployment parameters and address.\"",
