          "dct:bibliographicCitation": "PDF p. 12",
          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"Replicates the entire protocol/participation disclosure schema across each blockchain network on which the issuer operates infrastructure or has deployed smart contracts, thereby eliminating the potential for aggregation masking\"",
