          "dct:bibliographicCitation": "PDF p. 4",
          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"The BNP disclosure framework is built on a strict one-to-one correspondence between disclosure questions (inputs) and XBRL taxonomy concepts (outputs).\"",
