          "dct:bibliographicCitation": "PDF p. 3",
          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"Validator concentration ratios, affiliate consensus participation, MEV mitigation policies, and slashing event histories each bear directly on the risk\"",
