          "cmns-docc:hasTextualContent": "Verbatim: \"The final guidance offers the agencies' views on sound risk management principles for banking organizations when developing and implementing risk management practices for all stages in the life cycle of third-party relationships.\" Banking-agency guidance, cited by analogy. Status: the OCC, Board, FDIC and NCUA proposed on Sept. 15, 2026 to rescind and replace this guidance (91 FR 58536; comments due Nov. 16, 2026).",
          "cmns-doc:refersTo": {
            "@id": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2023/06/09/2023-12340/interagency-guidance-on-third-party-relationships-risk-management"
