          "cmns-av:explanatoryNote": "Form 1-CRYPTO Part I Item 2: the issuer and selling-securityholder portions of the aggregate offering price add up to the number of securities offered times the price per security (Rule 100 definition of aggregate offering price; Rule 101(e)).",
          "sbrm-mm:sequence": 128,
          "xbrlb:sourceIndex": 127
        },
        {
          "@id": "regca-1crypto:rule/REGCA_F_PARTI_02",
