          "skos:definition": {
            "@value": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. Rule 100 requires cash received in a foreign currency to be translated into U.S. dollars at an exchange rate in effect on, or a reasonable time before, the date of sale. On, or a reasonable time before, the sale date.",
