            "@value": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. Signatures for the answer on offerings in the previous 12 months, given in the manner of Forms 10-K and 10-Q (the signature blocks of Forms 1-KC and 1-SC use the same words): an entity signs through a person duly authorized to sign on its behalf; a person signs on his or her own behalf; each signer's name and title are printed, and each capacity is shown. One capacity in which the person signs, from the same list as the form's signatories. A person who signs in more than one capacity signs once and indicates each capacity in a row of the capacity table under the same signature (Form 10-K General Instruction D(2)(b); Form 10-Q General Instruction G).",
