            "@value": "Aggregated concentration and systemic risk [abstract]",
            "@language": "en"
          },
          "skos:definition": {
            "@value": "Proposed by Auditchain Labs; not required by the proposed rule. Combined control by the issuer and its affiliates on each network, and whether together they could influence consensus.",
